authorship -- but the work of discovering them is real, and the projects that
did it are named here whether or not any of their code is present.

Nothing in this section is currently incorporated into OmniHub. As that
changes, the entry gains the files concerned, and the files themselves carry
the original copyright header. A licence that permits reuse is not a licence to
